    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Do you love cats?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Would you feel blissful if you ran both a cattery and a cat caf\u00e9?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a cattery owner and caf\u00e9 manager, your days are filled with fluffy surprises!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the morning, you care for breeding cats at the cattery; in the afternoon and evening, you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >bring the cats to run the caf\u00e9.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your own cattery and caf\u00e9, and freely cuddle cats of all breeds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join now to begin your Cat-pitalist journey!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Do you love cats?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Would you feel blissful if you ran both a cattery and a cat caf\u00e9?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a cattery owner and caf\u00e9 manager, your days are filled with fluffy surprises!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the morning, you care for breeding cats at the cattery; in the afternoon and evening, you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >bring the cats to run the caf\u00e9.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your own cattery and caf\u00e9, and freely cuddle cats of all breeds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join now to begin your Cat-pitalist journey!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "You run both a cattery and a cat caf\u00e9. In the morning, you take care of breeding cats at the cattery, and in the afternoon and evening, you bring the cats to manage the cat caf\u00e9. You can decorate your own cattery and caf\u00e9, and freely interact with cats of different breeds.",
